\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {4}{\ignorespaces Trajectory interventions plotted in the $(\text  {Gen-PPL}, H_{\mathrm  {ps}})$ plane on ELF-B. Both ECP finals ($t_{\mathrm  {on}}=0.50$, 3 seeds) and controls lie directly on the unmodified ELF baseline frontier ($\le 0.2\%$ residual at matched entropy), while the three lower/in-range CMLC adaptive early-exit variants are strictly Pareto-dominated in the 2D $(\text  {Gen-PPL}, H_{\mathrm  {ps}})$ plane ($+36.3\%$ to $+160.1\%$) and the fourth (\texttt  {+ commit}, Gen-PPL $230.90$) lies above the 16-step baseline entropy range ($H_{\mathrm  {ps}}=5.542$ nats).}}{17}{figure.caption.28}\protected@file@percent }
